{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50745","headline":"观濠州田中丞出腊 · 张祜","name":"观濠州田中丞出腊","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东城晓出静尘埃，紫画神旗向日开。\n锦袖半攘争捧辔，银鞍不下小传盃。\n马盘草上朱弓满，鴈落云中白羽回。\n晚向三通残皷尽，北原千骑卷行来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50745.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50745","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}